[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MaksymShostak/oxygen-not-included/main/docs/badges/Dlc3Yes.png[/img] [img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MaksymShostak/oxygen-not-included/main/docs/badges/Dlc4Yes.png[/img] [img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MaksymShostak/oxygen-not-included/main/docs/badges/Dlc5Yes.png[/img]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]🚀 Key Features[/h1]
[list]
[*] [b]Thermal Filtering:[/b] Set minimum and maximum temperature limits on storage lockers, storage tiles, refrigerators, and other delivery targets.
[*] [b]Intelligent Routing:[/b] Duplicants will ignore containers if the material's temperature lies outside your set limits. No more melting ice in storage!
[*] [b]Construction Limits (Optional):[/b] Enable material temperature limits for blueprints to keep hot materials away from insulated structures or cryogenic chambers.
[*] [b]Thermo Sensor-Style Controls:[/b] Configure storage limits directly from the building side-screen with independent "At least" and "Below" thresholds, external unit labels (C, F, K), and full copy-paste support.
[*] [b]Clear & Legible Feedback:[/b] Features a dedicated [b]Clear[/b] button to wipe limits instantly, live plain-language status summaries (with color-coded warnings if limits overlap), and seamless keyboard navigation (Tab between fields, Enter to commit, Escape to cancel).
[*] [b]Multilingual Support:[/b] Fully localized into 18 languages using native game translation catalogs.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]⚡ What's New in the "Supercooled" Version?[/h1]
The backend of the original mod has been completely overhauled to run as cleanly as a Thermo Regulator in a vacuum:

[list]
[*] [b]Late-Game Performance:[/b] Asteroid-wide item scans are gone: each building keeps its allowed temperature range on file, and errands check the file directly. Cycle 1000+ mega-bases hold up.
[*] [b]Storage Tiles Check the Thermometer:[/b] Storage Tiles now support delivery temperature limits, including aboard rockets. When a limit is set, Duplicants will no longer tuck volcano-fresh cargo under the floor and stamp it "properly stored." Thanks to [url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/shylion]ShyLion[/url] for the rocket sauna report.
[*] [b]Fresh Start on Every Load:[/b] Returning to the main menu sweeps out all background tracking. A bin in your shiny new colony will never be haunted by the temperature rules of one you abandoned.
[*] [b]Thermo Sensor-Grade Interface Overhaul:[/b] Rebuilt the temperature side-screen from the ground up inspired by the colony's [b]Thermo Sensors[/b]: independent "At least" and "Below" inputs that never fight each other, units pinned outside text boxes, a one-click [b]Clear[/b] button, and a live status readout highlighting inverted limits in warning yellow.
[*] [b]Unjammed Colony Steering (No More Swallowed WASD):[/b] Touching a temperature box no longer causes the overhead camera to seize up as if someone spilled hot Nectar on the controls. Panning (WASD), pausing (Space), and Escape are never swallowed by active input boxes.
[*] [b]Modernized Mod Options Terminal:[/b] Rebuilt into a dedicated colony dialog with live temperature previews in C / F / K, a one-click [b]Reset to Defaults[/b] button, and full keyboard navigation (Tab, Enter, Escape).
[*] [b]Global Colony Localization:[/b] Bundles 18 community translations deployed automatically into your game installation out of the box.
[*] [b]Rock-Solid Startup & Stability:[/b] Pre-checks game hooks on startup and during colony refreshes, preventing crashes and ensuring safe loading every cycle.
[*] [b]Custom Mod Storage Support:[/b] Storage containers, hoppers, and lockers introduced by other mods are automatically detected and supported out of the box.
[*] [b]Fast Track Compatibility:[/b] Runs alongside Peter Han's [url=https://github.com/peterhaneve/ONIMods/tree/main/FastTrack][i]Fast Track[/i][/url] if installed, with zero overhead on the standard game engine.
[*] [b]Fully Tested on Current Game Builds:[/b] Tested and verified against the latest game updates (Build 744825+).
[/list]

