[hr][/hr]

[h1]🛠️ Mod Settings[/h1]
Adjust mod settings directly in the game Options menu with our modernized dialog:
[list]
[*] [b]Include Temperature in "Lacks Resources" Warning:[/b] Toggle whether the yellow "Lacks Resources" warning takes temperature limits into account (turn off for maximum late-game performance).
[*] [b]Apply Limits to Construction Materials:[/b] Toggle whether temperature limits apply to materials delivered for blueprints (prevents using hot materials in cold-area construction).
[*] [b]Real-Time Temperature Previews:[/b] Test and preview temperature thresholds dynamically in Celsius, Fahrenheit, or Kelvin with automatic unit conversion.
[*] [b]Troubleshooting Reports:[/b] Generate a quick, privacy-safe report directly from the menu to help diagnose mod conflicts if anything ever behaves strangely.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]🐛 Support & Bug Reports[/h1]
If you encounter an issue, open Mod Options in-game and choose [b]Create Support Report[/b] (or [b]Create Extended Support Report[/b] with sanitized log excerpt) to generate a privacy-safe local diagnostic file. Review it on your computer, then attach it to the [url=https://github.com/MaksymShostak/oxygen-not-included/issues/new?template=temperature-limit-bug.yml]bug report form[/url].

